  "The cultural exchange with the West was formed in two periods. They are:\nA. The period of Dai Nam culture and the period of Modern culture\nB. The period of Van Lang - Au Lac culture and The period of Northern Feudal culture\nC. The period of anti-North colonial culture and the period of Dai Viet culture\nD. All are incorrect\nA",
