  "The quartet of Dragon, Unicorn, Turtles, Phoenix are commonly used in traditional painting and sculpture with many profound meanings. In it, the image of the Unicorn means:\nA. Symbol the wish for peace.\nB. Symbol of power\nC. Symbol of long life\nD. Symbol of happiness\nA",
  "In Vietnamese history, the religion that served as the basis for great national unity was:\nA. Taoism\nB. Buddhism\nC. Confucianism\nD. Catholicism\nB",
  "In Vietnamese history, which religion was once associated with patriotism?\nA. Christianity\nB. Buddhism\nC. Taoism\nD. Hinduism\nB",
