  "Choose the TRUE statement about sports and leisure in the middle of the 1990s.\nA. The SRV has given priority to less expensive sports which require little equipment and few training facilities.\nB. Sponsorship of sports activities by private sponsors is prohibited\nC. Only the higher-level athletic competitions, with the official organization, are avidly followed by Vietnamese fans\nD. The international corporations-including producers of soft drinks, cigarettes, and alcoholic beverages- began stopping sponsoring Vietnamese national competitions\nA",
