  "What were the biggest changes of Vietnamese literature under the influence of Tu Luc Van Doan? (Choose TWO options)\nA. The appearance of New Poetry\nB. The appearance of New Verses\nC. The creation of a direct and clear Quoc Ngu modern prose style\nD. The liberation of Quoc Ngu from Chinese loan words\nAC",
