  "Which of the following best characterizes the evolution of tan nhac (modern Vietnamese music) from the 1930s through the 1970s?\nA. It remained strictly traditional and ceremonial throughout the decades\nB. It rejected all Western musical influences in favor of ancient instruments\nC. It transitioned from romantic and revolutionary themes to antiwar reflections\nD. It was exclusively composed by French-trained Vietnamese artists\nC",
