  "What was the purpose of the cay neu (bamboo \"tree\") during Tet celebrations?\nA. To symbolize the coming of spring\nB. To celebrate the Lunar New Year with colorful decorations\nC. To mark the household's wealth and prosperity\nD. To attract benevolent spirits and repel malevolent ones\nD",
