  "How do young people today compare to previous generations in terms of interest in traditional music?\nA. They have an interest in traditional music.\nB. They have the same level of interest in traditional music as previous generations.\nC. They do not have the same intense interest in traditional music as previous generations\nD. They are uninterested in traditional music.\nC",
