  "As presented by Geoffrey Murray in Culture Smart! Vietnam (2021), according to proper chopstick etiquette, which of the following is correct?\nA. You can pick up multiple pieces of food at once if it's your favorite dish\nB. You should not pick up more than one morsel at a time\nC. Picking up more food shows your skill\nD. It's normal to eat directly from the communal plate\nB",
