  "The third industrial revolution, based on electronics and information technology from the last decades of the 20th century, has brought humanity into the era of globalization ?\nA. Electronics and Information Technology\nB. Agriculture and Livestock Farming\nC. Finance and Accounting\nD. Tourism and Exports\nA",
