  "What principles does the 2001 Porto Alegre World Social Forum's \"Call for Mobilization\" advocate for to shape a different globalization?\nA. Emphasis on economic growth and technological advancement.\nB. Prioritizing political stability and transparent governance.\nC. Focusing on sustainable society, democratic governments, and environmental care.\nD. Encouraging maximum consumption of natural resources for development.\nC",
  "What benefits of betel and areca nuts are mentioned in ancient medical books?\nA. They help brighten the skin\nB. They freshen the breath, reduce bad temper, and aid digestion\nC. They improve vision and memory\nD. They help soothe coughs and colds\nB",
